        "richtext": "Every sticker marks a moment your kid will remember long after you forget the mess - and this is what keeps everything moving. Once that poster goes up,<strong> your kid becomes the one pushing the whole thing forward. </strong>They’ll wake you up begging for the next mission, demand another sticker, and brag to the entire family about what “Dad and I did today.” And suddenly, you don’t need to worry about doing enough - <em>they</em> will remind you. <strong>Not out of pressure, but out of pure excitement to make more memories with you.</strong> Every sticker becomes a snapshot of childhood. Every spot on that poster becomes a moment they’ll carry forever. <strong>This isn’t decoration. It’s the engine of the whole experience.  </strong>",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_label": "Shop Now",
        "button_class": "Your custom CTA class",
